            "max_width_desktop": "135ch",
            "richtext": "<p>Homes with pets generate additional dust from dander and fur. The<a href=\"https://www.blueair.com/products/blue-pure-311i-plus-max\"> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Blue Pure 311i+ Max</span></a> handles dust and<a href=\"https://www.blueair.com/blogs/news/pet-odor-solutions-nontoxic-sustainable-air-care-that-s-safe-for-pets-and-your-home\"> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">pet-related particles</span></a> across rooms up to 525 ft² in 12.5 minutes, 1,260 ft² in 30 minutes, & 2,520 ft² in 1 hour, with a CADR of Pollen 446 cfm, Dust 370 cfm, Smoke 339 cfm. GermShield technology adds protection against bacteria that can build up in pet-heavy environments. Upgrading to the<a href=\"https://www.blueair.com/collections/air-purifier-filters\"> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">AllergenBlock filter</span></a> adds targeted performance against dust and dander.</p><p>Auto mode, app control, and Alexa and Google voice control are all included. The washable fabric pre-filter catches pet hair and large dust particles before they reach the main HEPASilent™ filter, which helps extend filter life in dusty environments.</p><h4><strong>Pick #3: Blue Pure 311i Max, Best Value for Dust Control</strong></h4>",
