            "max_width_desktop": "135ch",
            "richtext": "<p>Coverage of 439 ft² in 12.5 minutes, 1,054 ft² in 30 minutes, & 2,107 ft² in 1 hour with a CADR of Pollen 365 cfm, Dust 314 cfm, and Smoke 283 cfm at $189.99 makes the<a href=\"https://www.blueair.com/products/blue-pure-311i-max\"> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Blue Pure 311i Max</span></a> an excellent value option for average-sized rooms. All the core features are included: auto mode, PM2.5 sensor,<a href=\"https://www.blueair.com/pages/blueair-app\"> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">app control</span></a>, and night mode. For a guest bedroom, home office, or mid-size living space where dust is the main concern and budget matters, the performance-to-price ratio is strong.</p><h4><strong>Pick #4: </strong><a href=\"https://www.blueair.com/products/blue-signature-midnight?_pos=3&_sid=7502195f8&_ss=r\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Blue Signature</strong></span></a><strong>, Best for Highly Dust-Prone Homes</strong></h4>",
