            "padding_top_desktop": "desktop:pt-0",
            "padding_bottom_desktop": "desktop:pb-0",
            "max_width_desktop": "135ch",
            "richtext": "<p>For home renovations, high-traffic households, or anyone who genuinely struggles with dust accumulation regardless of how often cleaning happens, the Blue Signature goes further. Seven stages of filtration, a CADR of 434 CFM for dust, and coverage of 705 ft² in 12.5 minutes & up to 3,385 ft² in 1 hour. OdorFence Technology also handles the musty, stale smell that often accompanies heavy dust accumulation. A patent-pending filter design doubles filter lifetime compared to previous models.</p><h4><strong>Pick #5: Blue Pure 511i Max, Best for Bedrooms</strong></h4>",
